From a2a6f780c71887c58c8438b9e0c39c62d52f12a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kiro Agent <244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 20:10:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): UpCloud-aware + Order VPS/Cloud9/Fastpanel &
 Install Cloud9/Fastpanel

- RDP provisioning is now UpCloud-aware: RDP port via rdpPortForToken (UpCloud
  8443, else 4443), correct base image (upcloud/ubuntu22.04), UpCloud SSH-key
  auth passed to installer; manual RDP install lets user pick provider for port.
- New services (bot-agnostic, reuse handlers' logic):
  * vpsService: Order VPS (create only, deliver root creds; UpCloud root-pass provision)
  * cloud9Service: Order Cloud9 (AWS-only) + Install Cloud9 on user VPS
  * fastpanelService: Order Fastpanel (all providers) + Install Fastpanel on user VPS
- checkoutService generalised into a registry (kind -> prepare()), unified
  saldo-vs-QRIS payment + refund/stock-release for every service.
- server: single POST /api/order {kind,params} + per-service catalog endpoints.
- frontend: Order sub-tabs (RDP/VPS/Cloud9/Fastpanel) + Install sub-tabs
  (RDP/Cloud9/Fastpanel); job cards show URL for Cloud9/Fastpanel; only digital
  product shop is excluded, per request.
